    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Apr 2026 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毛选笔记：第三篇，第一册想分享的最后一期内容，《中国革命战争的战略问题》</span><br><span></span><strong><span>6个观点+1个案例，欢迎DAJA一起带着问题读毛选，</span></strong><span>万事万物都在随时变化，戒骄戒躁，共勉！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰本期时间戳：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 六个观点简述</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 主线任务&amp;旁支任务</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 顶级领导力，是构建可触达的图景</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> 战略可持久，战术分情况</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 躬身入局做调查，发挥系统能动性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 接受事物的动态变化，而非一蹴而就</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">12:19</a> 跟广大人民站在一起</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 分享如何开好1个会（实践6条观点的领导）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📕 猜你感兴趣：</span><br><span>英剧《白宫杀人事件》：观鸟要看鸟类的生存背景</span><br><span>鲁豫窦文涛访谈：允许提愚蠢的问题</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jCpizuEPg/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;vd_source=056e50a5bbca6e5fbcaf1e063c053cf6" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jCpizuEPg/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;vd_source=056e50a5bbca6e5fbcaf1e063c053cf6"><span>对话窦文涛，聊聊我们的30年 ｜陈鲁豫·慢谈EP03【视频播客】_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《中国革命战争的战略问题》B站解读：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1534y1A7Bw/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;vd_source=056e50a5bbca6e5fbcaf1e063c053cf6" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1534y1A7Bw/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;vd_source=056e50a5bbca6e5fbcaf1e063c053cf6"><span>教员的保姆式教学让你从此拥有顶级战略家思维【《毛泽东选集》启示录-09】_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span><br><span>Novo Amor - Weather_EM</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群🔗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnsq7MfcMOOpOqyTnTl3HF27e0kr.jfif"></figure>]]></description>
